{
    "reasoner_response": "Inform the customer that their contract includes towing assistance—when their vehicle is inoperable or unsafe to drive, it can be towed to the closest repair facility or another location they request. For towing, they should call {pii_immediate_genagent_persistence.LOC:************} at *-***-***-**** for dispatch service. Regarding rental benefits, let them know that rental coverage applies only if a breakdown renders the vehicle inoperable or unsafe and requires overnight repairs at a facility. Since there are no claims on file, explain that rental eligibility requires an authorized claim; the next step would be for the repair facility to contact the Claims department to start the claim process. Ask if they would like more details about starting a claim or have other questions about their rental benefits.",
    "communication_rules": [
        "- If the customer tried to change the topic while you are waiting for Supervisor instructions, before following any Reasoner's instructions, ask the customer whether they want to switch to the new topic or continue with the current one.",
        "- If any previous requests were prevented from execution, they can now be re-evaluated and executed if appropriate. Make a new function/tool request to do so."
    ]
}
